linhas.en:
Seeing what should not be seen;
touching what should not be touched;
eating what should not be eaten.

linhas.pt:
Ver o que não deve ser visto;
tocar o que não deve ser tocado;
comer o que não deve ser comido.

linhas.en:
The voice of her unconscious mind wasn't
rejecting an invading, foreign body;
rather, it was filled with an intoxication as if welcoming it.
